#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:4
msgid ""
"Our Ceph cluster also provides an S3-compatible object storage. The data "
"in the cluster is transparently encrypted before being stored onto "
"physical disks, see [](#data-at-rest-encryption) for details."
msgstr ""

