#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:474
msgid "Object Storage Feature Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:476
msgid ""
"Our object storage is powered by **Ceph** using the RadosGW service. "
"While we aim for 100% S3 compatibility, due to the fact that S3 is a "
"vendor-specific defacto standard, not all of original AWS features are "
"available and may diverge over time depending on decisions made by Amazon"
" and the ability of the Ceph commmunity to  adapt to those changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:481
msgid ""
"If you need specific features, you can check the [Ceph S3 feature support"
" matrix](https://docs.ceph.com/en/nautilus/radosgw/s3/#features-support)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:483
msgid ""
"Some features may be supported but are subject to further conditions "
"within our cluster. At the moment the following notes apply:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:485
msgid ""
"Version support is not yet fully unreliable and we've seen bucket "
"corruption in the past."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:486
msgid "We do not provide different storage classes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../src/infrastructure/object-storage.md:487
msgid ""
"Features supported by Ceph, but unsupported by us: **Bucket Request "
"Payment**, **Bucket Website**"
msgstr ""

